1
00:00:57,042 --> 00:01:01,004
We have decided to
convince Roswell Corporation

2
00:01:01,004 --> 00:01:04,132
to invest in our university.

3
00:01:09,012 --> 00:01:11,807
This angel is so handsome.

4
00:01:12,072 --> 00:01:13,892
But before we begin,

5
00:01:15,060 --> 00:01:16,520
party hats for everyone.

6
00:01:16,520 --> 00:01:18,355
Stop this nonsense!

7
00:01:18,355 --> 00:01:19,731
If you won't sign that,

8
00:01:20,148 --> 00:01:22,275
my investments in your companies

9
00:01:22,275 --> 00:01:23,110
will be forfeited.

10
00:01:23,110 --> 00:01:24,069
What?

11
00:01:24,069 --> 00:01:24,945
Yes!

12
00:01:25,153 --> 00:01:26,405
I'm Ezekiel Roswell

13
00:01:27,072 --> 00:01:27,948
and we are married.

14
00:01:29,199 --> 00:01:31,076
Damn, Zeke!

15
00:01:31,493 --> 00:01:33,870
It's like twice the
size of our house!

16
00:01:33,995 --> 00:01:35,038
Welcome to your new home.

17
00:01:35,122 --> 00:01:37,165
What is it that you
really want me to know?

18
00:01:38,166 --> 00:01:39,793
That I'm a mafia boss.

19
00:01:39,918 --> 00:01:43,004
Even if you were the
worst person in the world,

20
00:01:43,588 --> 00:01:44,965
I love you, Zeke.

21
00:01:50,429 --> 00:01:53,890
I am Alyana Heartily-Ferrer.

22
00:01:53,890 --> 00:01:56,059
This is my wife,

23
00:01:56,935 --> 00:01:58,937
Aemie Ferrer-Roswell.

24
00:01:59,104 --> 00:02:00,105
Zeke?

25
00:02:01,398 --> 00:02:02,190
Mommy!

26
00:02:02,441 --> 00:02:04,860
Mommy, who did this to you?!

27
00:02:04,860 --> 00:02:05,819
Roswell.

28
00:02:09,197 --> 00:02:11,491
The Roswells are our enemies.

29
00:02:15,412 --> 00:02:16,621
From now on,

30
00:02:16,621 --> 00:02:19,833
we will form an alliance.

31
00:02:19,958 --> 00:02:23,295
We will bring down the Roswells.

32
00:02:23,795 --> 00:02:24,755
This.

33
00:02:25,255 --> 00:02:26,047
Is.

34
00:02:26,339 --> 00:02:27,048
War.

35
00:02:28,258 --> 00:02:31,845
We are launching a
war against the Roswells.

36
00:02:38,018 --> 00:02:42,564
We will take down Ezekiel
Roswell once and for all!

37
00:02:58,330 --> 00:02:59,664
I'm such a great actress, right?

38
00:03:00,957 --> 00:03:03,293
So, are you confused now?

39
00:03:03,293 --> 00:03:05,921
Have you caught Dong's
occasional slowness too?

40
00:03:05,921 --> 00:03:08,757
It was all just
acting, don't worry.

41
00:03:08,757 --> 00:03:10,342
Can I be an actress now?

42
00:03:10,342 --> 00:03:12,552
I even look like
that talented actress,

43
00:03:12,886 --> 00:03:14,054
Rhen Escaño.

44
00:03:14,054 --> 00:03:14,679
Right?

45
00:03:14,679 --> 00:03:16,014
Come on, agree with me.

46
00:03:16,039 --> 00:03:18,083
I'm even letting you in on the plan.

47
00:04:05,438 --> 00:04:08,108
Zeke said only we
should know about this.

48
00:04:08,108 --> 00:04:11,111
But I'll share it with you
so you won't get confused.

49
00:04:11,111 --> 00:04:12,946
Zeke and I are really okay.

50
00:04:13,446 --> 00:04:14,322
Look.

51
00:04:19,661 --> 00:04:21,496
I believe you.

52
00:04:48,315 --> 00:04:50,191
Is there a problem,
Ezekiel Roswell?

53
00:04:50,483 --> 00:04:51,367
What?

54
00:04:53,028 --> 00:04:53,882
None.

55
00:04:57,198 --> 00:04:58,283
What?

56
00:04:58,783 --> 00:05:00,035
What "none?"

57
00:05:01,745 --> 00:05:02,871
There is!

58
00:05:03,163 --> 00:05:04,915
There is a problem, Zeke!

59
00:05:05,790 --> 00:05:06,374
The—

60
00:05:06,374 --> 00:05:07,834
Zeke is so slow!

61
00:05:16,426 --> 00:05:17,886
Dong almost gave it away there.

62
00:05:17,886 --> 00:05:20,096
Dong really is such
a handful, isn't he?

63
00:05:20,096 --> 00:05:22,057
Actually, he really did cry.

64
00:05:22,057 --> 00:05:24,809
But I didn't show it
because, "Mafia Boss,"

65
00:05:24,809 --> 00:05:25,936
crying all the time?!

66
00:05:25,936 --> 00:05:27,979
Anyway, at least
you can see now?

67
00:05:27,979 --> 00:05:29,439
Dong and I are really okay.

68
00:05:29,439 --> 00:05:31,650
I'm even okay with the Yaji now.

69
00:05:33,109 --> 00:05:35,028
Turns out they aren't our enemies.

70
00:05:35,108 --> 00:05:37,986
The only real enemies
are the Swanseas.

71
00:05:38,156 --> 00:05:40,158
Their leader is Violet Swansea.

72
00:05:40,241 --> 00:05:43,328
And apparently, she wants to
replace Mommy as the Queen of Yaji.

73
00:05:43,328 --> 00:05:45,914
I didn't even know Mommy
was the Queen of Yaji.

74
00:05:45,914 --> 00:05:49,167
Anyway, we need to
keep an eye on Violet.

75
00:05:49,167 --> 00:05:51,878
So the plan is to pretend
that Dong and I aren't okay.

76
00:05:52,504 --> 00:05:53,338
Aemie,

77
00:05:53,338 --> 00:05:55,173
you should stay at
my mansion for now

78
00:05:55,173 --> 00:05:57,092
while your mother recovers.

79
00:06:00,053 --> 00:06:04,015
Good thing Daddy beat me
to it before I could even ask.

80
00:06:06,518 --> 00:06:08,353
Do we have fortune-telling
blood in the family?

81
00:06:09,854 --> 00:06:12,743
I hope he doesn't figure out that
this is part of our plan.

82
00:06:17,529 --> 00:06:19,280
Welcome home.

83
00:06:20,657 --> 00:06:22,325
It's beautiful, right?

84
00:06:24,160 --> 00:06:25,578
Do you like your room?

85
00:06:33,128 --> 00:06:34,170
It's okay.

86
00:06:34,796 --> 00:06:36,715
I will let you settle down.

87
00:06:51,056 --> 00:06:53,016
It's so beautiful!

88
00:06:53,648 --> 00:06:55,483
It's beautiful!

89
00:06:55,483 --> 00:06:57,110
It's so pink!

90
00:07:06,453 --> 00:07:09,039
Unlike Zeke's house,
there's no color at all!

91
00:07:19,007 --> 00:07:20,035
Hello, Dong!

92
00:07:20,258 --> 00:07:22,552
My room is so
beautiful, it's all pink!

93
00:07:23,303 --> 00:07:24,721
As expected.

94
00:07:25,263 --> 00:07:26,129
Huh?

95
00:07:26,765 --> 00:07:28,099
What, are you a fortune teller?

96
00:07:30,977 --> 00:07:31,978
Go ahead!

97
00:07:32,270 --> 00:07:34,189
Guess what I'm doing right now.

98
00:07:35,273 --> 00:07:36,121
Ribbit.

99
00:07:37,025 --> 00:07:37,785
Ribbit.

100
00:07:38,610 --> 00:07:39,418
Ribbit.

101
00:07:40,241 --> 00:07:40,972
Tss. Stupid

102
00:07:41,613 --> 00:07:42,434
Ribbit.

103
00:07:42,822 --> 00:07:43,731
Ribbit.

104
00:07:43,865 --> 00:07:44,532
Ribbit.

105
00:07:49,287 --> 00:07:50,205
Ri-bit!

106
00:07:50,789 --> 00:07:51,331
Ribbit!

107
00:07:52,540 --> 00:07:53,875
Are you okay, dear?

108
00:07:54,042 --> 00:07:54,709
Ribbit.

109
00:07:55,001 --> 00:07:56,127
Ribbit!

110
00:07:59,422 --> 00:08:00,381
I'm okay.

111
00:08:09,349 --> 00:08:11,142
That's Violet alright.

112
00:08:11,643 --> 00:08:13,144
And she's wearing violet too.

113
00:08:13,144 --> 00:08:14,104
All purple.

114
00:08:14,771 --> 00:08:16,773
If I ever buy a baby,

115
00:08:16,773 --> 00:08:18,108
I'll name her Pink.

116
00:08:18,775 --> 00:08:19,651
Or maybe...

117
00:08:20,318 --> 00:08:21,277
Magenta!

118
00:08:21,736 --> 00:08:22,445
Or...

119
00:08:22,862 --> 00:08:23,988
Scarlet?

120
00:08:24,447 --> 00:08:25,990
Oh, no, wait!

121
00:08:26,282 --> 00:08:27,192
Cloud—

122
00:08:27,659 --> 00:08:28,387
Cloud...

123
00:08:28,827 --> 00:08:29,994
Aemie.

124
00:08:31,496 --> 00:08:33,915
What you've been
through is very painful.

125
00:08:35,458 --> 00:08:37,335
That's why I'm
here to support you

126
00:08:37,335 --> 00:08:39,587
in any way that I can.

127
00:08:40,338 --> 00:08:42,340
You can call me Auntie Violet.

128
00:08:42,798 --> 00:08:44,049
Or even better,

129
00:08:44,419 --> 00:08:46,922
Mommy Violet if you want it.

130
00:08:52,976 --> 00:08:54,060
I prefer Auntie Violet.

131
00:09:05,155 --> 00:09:06,364
It hurts.

132
00:09:09,576 --> 00:09:10,743
It's okay.

133
00:09:12,162 --> 00:09:14,247
I'm used to being rejected.

134
00:09:18,543 --> 00:09:19,460
Huh?

135
00:09:20,545 --> 00:09:22,046
I thought she was evil?

136
00:09:22,589 --> 00:09:23,810
Then why is she crying?

137
00:09:24,841 --> 00:09:25,884
I feel sorry for her now.

138
00:09:25,884 --> 00:09:27,135
Acting is so hard!

139
00:09:30,138 --> 00:09:31,472
Please don't be sad.

140
00:09:33,308 --> 00:09:34,684
It's okay, dear?

141
00:09:35,768 --> 00:09:37,437
I understand you.

142
00:09:37,812 --> 00:09:41,733
I know that I can never
replace your mother.

143
00:09:42,901 --> 00:09:45,069
But just in case,

144
00:09:45,320 --> 00:09:47,572
she won't wake up anymore—

145
00:09:47,572 --> 00:09:48,907
Get out of my room.

146
00:09:53,960 --> 00:09:55,462
Dear, I'm sorry.

147
00:09:55,788 --> 00:09:56,581
Get out!

148
00:10:21,773 --> 00:10:22,232
Dong.

149
00:10:22,774 --> 00:10:24,067
Why did you drop the call?

150
00:10:24,484 --> 00:10:25,151
So annoying!

151
00:10:25,151 --> 00:10:27,111
That Violet is such
an attention seeker.

152
00:10:27,111 --> 00:10:28,863
She came into my
room and made a scene.

153
00:10:29,197 --> 00:10:30,865
She's really annoying.

154
00:10:31,741 --> 00:10:32,659
Don't mind her.

155
00:10:32,659 --> 00:10:33,451
Sleep now.

156
00:10:33,451 --> 00:10:34,661
You need a lot of rest.

157
00:10:34,827 --> 00:10:36,871
This is just the
beginning of our plan.

158
00:10:38,665 --> 00:10:39,290
Right.

159
00:10:40,041 --> 00:10:40,792
Okay, sure.

160
00:10:41,918 --> 00:10:43,127
Goodnight, Dong.

161
00:10:43,378 --> 00:10:45,088
You too, okay? Go
to sleep too, okay?

162
00:10:45,797 --> 00:10:46,714
I love you.

163
00:10:47,257 --> 00:10:48,633
Aww, are you blushing?

164
00:10:50,385 --> 00:10:53,846
That night, I thought she had died.

165
00:10:55,306 --> 00:10:58,268
We had no choice but to run.

166
00:11:00,603 --> 00:11:02,689
Your mother and I got separated,

167
00:11:04,983 --> 00:11:08,611
and we sent her and
your Auntie Sylvia ahead.

168
00:11:10,363 --> 00:11:11,739
We agreed

169
00:11:12,407 --> 00:11:15,702
to meet at the end of a bridge.

170
00:11:16,869 --> 00:11:17,537
But...

171
00:11:18,579 --> 00:11:20,248
But after the battle,

172
00:11:23,042 --> 00:11:24,961
I couldn't find her.

173
00:11:25,920 --> 00:11:27,964
I waited there for so long.

174
00:11:31,092 --> 00:11:33,511
I wonder where
Daddy read this story.

175
00:11:34,387 --> 00:11:36,723
It's not what Zeke told me at all.

176
00:11:44,245 --> 00:11:46,038
I waited for so long.

177
00:11:48,609 --> 00:11:50,236
But the only one who came...

178
00:11:50,862 --> 00:11:52,155
was Violet.

179
00:11:53,489 --> 00:11:57,952
Then she told me that
the Roswells had killed

180
00:11:58,661 --> 00:12:00,038
your mother,

181
00:12:01,202 --> 00:12:02,364
Sylvia,

182
00:12:03,283 --> 00:12:04,534
and Amesyl.

183
00:12:08,421 --> 00:12:09,426
Ro—

184
00:12:11,257 --> 00:12:12,508
Roswells?

185
00:12:16,429 --> 00:12:17,930
This is so annoying.

186
00:12:19,265 --> 00:12:20,892
I'm crying because

187
00:12:21,309 --> 00:12:24,437
that Violet's story is all wrong.

188
00:12:24,437 --> 00:12:26,105
First, Mommy is still alive,

189
00:12:26,105 --> 00:12:27,815
and so is my cuz.

190
00:12:28,649 --> 00:12:29,825
Fake news.

191
00:12:32,236 --> 00:12:33,654
So annoying!

192
00:12:33,654 --> 00:12:35,740
Violet's obviously onto something.

193
00:12:35,896 --> 00:12:38,524
Do they think they can escape from us?

194
00:12:38,743 --> 00:12:40,286
Alright, Jerson, I'll go ahead.

195
00:12:40,495 --> 00:12:41,829
It's too dangerous for you to go alone.

196
00:12:42,038 --> 00:12:43,414
I don't get why, Jerson.

197
00:12:43,706 --> 00:12:45,458
Even if the Roswells see me,

198
00:12:46,125 --> 00:12:47,543
They don't know
I'm part of Swansea.

199
00:12:47,669 --> 00:12:49,090
What does she think of me?

200
00:12:49,282 --> 00:12:50,575
A fucking dumbass?

201
00:12:52,715 --> 00:12:53,715
Hurry up.

202
00:12:55,468 --> 00:12:57,470
Why don't we just kill Arcadia?

203
00:13:00,098 --> 00:13:02,016
Let's just follow
Violet's plan for now.

204
00:13:09,065 --> 00:13:09,965
Wait.

205
00:13:12,151 --> 00:13:13,418
What are you looking at?

206
00:13:15,196 --> 00:13:16,176
Nothing.

207
00:13:18,116 --> 00:13:19,160
Oh.

208
00:13:19,367 --> 00:13:21,702
Zeke, they want to
kill Guardian Angel.

209
00:13:24,038 --> 00:13:25,465
I'll deal with the other guy.

210
00:13:35,133 --> 00:13:37,343
You distract Blood
so he won't notice me.

211
00:13:41,472 --> 00:13:42,140
Ah, shit.

212
00:13:43,099 --> 00:13:43,850
Miss Aemie.

213
00:13:46,477 --> 00:13:47,895
Who are you visiting here?

214
00:13:51,357 --> 00:13:52,400
You!

215
00:13:52,400 --> 00:13:53,401
I mean, you.

216
00:13:56,272 --> 00:13:57,982
You're Zeke's friend, aren't you?

217
00:13:59,547 --> 00:14:01,215
Yes, we used to be.

218
00:14:01,951 --> 00:14:04,078
But we don't talk anymore.

219
00:14:06,289 --> 00:14:07,749
You should be thankful.

220
00:14:11,252 --> 00:14:14,965
Because I really think Zeke
still considers him a friend.

221
00:14:15,065 --> 00:14:16,332
Because if he didn't,

222
00:14:16,507 --> 00:14:19,610
who knows what Zeke
would've done to Ken here.

223
00:14:19,635 --> 00:14:20,590
No?

224
00:14:22,388 --> 00:14:23,639
Ah, wait, hold on.

225
00:14:23,780 --> 00:14:24,739
Wait a second, Miss Aemie.

226
00:14:25,224 --> 00:14:27,935
Maybe you'd like to
have dinner with me?

227
00:14:30,563 --> 00:14:31,481
I still have something to do.

228
00:14:32,398 --> 00:14:33,239
Ah.

229
00:14:34,192 --> 00:14:35,231
Sure.

230
00:14:40,531 --> 00:14:42,992
I guess I distracted Ken properly, huh?

231
00:14:44,118 --> 00:14:45,953
Mission accomplished!

232
00:14:46,954 --> 00:14:48,331
Oh, you guys caught up.

233
00:14:48,331 --> 00:14:50,791
You probably thought
we'd really break up, huh?

234
00:14:50,816 --> 00:14:52,526
Zeke and I planned all of that.

235
00:14:52,710 --> 00:14:55,171
We're even going to
have our marriage annulled.

236
00:14:55,171 --> 00:14:56,964
So they'd really fall for it.

237
00:15:05,723 --> 00:15:09,560
Can you help my daughter get their
annulment done faster?

238
00:15:09,560 --> 00:15:11,103
I'll take care of it.

239
00:15:11,103 --> 00:15:11,979
Thank you.

240
00:15:28,663 --> 00:15:30,206
Cuz, where have you been?

241
00:15:32,583 --> 00:15:33,251
Dear,

242
00:15:34,669 --> 00:15:36,337
I've been waiting for you.

243
00:15:36,337 --> 00:15:37,547
Where did you go?

244
00:15:40,049 --> 00:15:42,385
Oh, just around here.

245
00:15:47,807 --> 00:15:48,891
Miss Aemie,

246
00:15:49,725 --> 00:15:51,018
please sign this.

247
00:16:03,061 --> 00:16:04,229
Annulment?

248
00:16:04,254 --> 00:16:05,588
Don't worry, dear.

249
00:16:05,700 --> 00:16:07,994
I'll make the annulment
process quick.

250
00:16:19,213 --> 00:16:22,925
Once I sign this,
I'll be Aemie Ferrer.

251
00:16:23,551 --> 00:16:25,553
Zeke and I won't
be married anymore.

252
00:16:26,095 --> 00:16:28,055
The new title of this show will be,

253
00:16:29,640 --> 00:16:32,977
My Ex-husband Is a Mafia Boss.

254
00:17:00,379 --> 00:17:01,255
Oh, there.

255
00:17:01,672 --> 00:17:03,633
A few tears to make it convincing.

256
00:17:31,994 --> 00:17:33,037
Hello, Dong?

257
00:17:33,954 --> 00:17:35,373
How are Milka and the others?

258
00:17:36,165 --> 00:17:38,000
The three idiots are fine.

259
00:17:38,459 --> 00:17:39,877
I miss you, wife.

260
00:17:41,087 --> 00:17:42,421
I miss you, too.

261
00:17:43,214 --> 00:17:45,731
But we were just together a while ago.

262
00:17:47,093 --> 00:17:48,114
You, ah.

263
00:17:51,430 --> 00:17:52,556
Ms. Aemie,

264
00:17:54,975 --> 00:17:57,019
you're still talking to Mr. Roswell?

265
00:18:02,817 --> 00:18:03,872
And so?

266
00:18:05,277 --> 00:18:07,780
I thought he already
filed for an annulment?

267
00:18:08,489 --> 00:18:09,365
But,

268
00:18:10,933 --> 00:18:13,018
it looks like you two
are still sweet together.

269
00:18:21,210 --> 00:18:25,506
Don't ask, and don't you
dare spill this to anyone.

270
00:18:26,882 --> 00:18:28,342
Unless you wanna die.

271
00:18:46,610 --> 00:18:47,820
It's beautiful, right?

272
00:18:47,820 --> 00:18:50,239
Don't you dare
spill this to anyone.

273
00:18:50,239 --> 00:18:51,449
Please sign this.

274
00:19:02,334 --> 00:19:04,462
Hey, open this!

275
00:19:06,630 --> 00:19:08,758
Hey, open this door!

276
00:19:09,341 --> 00:19:10,760
Open this!

277
00:19:10,760 --> 00:19:11,761
One!

278
00:19:12,303 --> 00:19:13,554
Is this a prank?

279
00:19:14,054 --> 00:19:15,514
This isn't funny

280
00:19:16,265 --> 00:19:17,641
Hey!

